# vhs script: record `make demo` for the README GIF (see demo-gif.md)
Output docs/demo.gif
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1100
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Type "make demo"
Enter
# `make demo` completes in roughly 5 s (14 experiments at 60x simulated time);
# this leaves a couple of seconds on the final signed-evidence frame.
Sleep 8s
